---
// CareerPathSection — "Dari Academy Menuju Dunia Kerja" with brand colors
---

<section class="section-padding bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800 text-white relative overflow-hidden" aria-label="Jalur Pengembangan Karier">
  <div class="container-custom relative z-10">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Copy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-600/10 text-brand-300 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-brand-600/20 mb-6">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
          Peluang Karier
        </span>
        <h2 class="heading-primary text-white mb-6">
          Dari Academy <br/><span class="text-brand-300 italic">Menuju Dunia Kerja</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Pitcar Academy lahir dari lingkungan bisnis bengkel yang nyata. Peserta yang menunjukkan kompetensi, attitude, dan performa yang baik selama program dapat memperoleh <strong class="text-brand-300 font-semibold">kesempatan untuk mengikuti proses rekrutmen</strong> sesuai kebutuhan jaringan PITCAR.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Selain itu, skill dan pengalaman yang diperoleh selama program menjadi bekal kuat untuk membangun karier berkelanjutan di industri otomotif maupun membuka usaha bengkel sendiri.
        </p>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10 text-xs text-slate-400 italic">
          💡 Kami percaya pada komitmen & performa transparan. Tidak ada klaim jaminan palsu — yang ada adalah jalur pembuktian kemampuan nyata.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Career Roadmap -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-600/20 text-brand-500 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">🚀</span>
            Jalur Pengembangan Kompetensi
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-4 relative">
            <!-- Connector Line -->
            <div class="absolute left-6 top-8 bottom-8 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-600 via-brand-500 to-brand-300 z-0"></div>

            <!-- Level 1 -->
            <div class="relative z-10 flex items-start gap-4 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Level 1</div>
                <div class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">Basic Mechanic</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Maintenance, Tune Up & Service Berkala</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Level 2 -->
            <div class="relative z-10 flex items-start gap-4 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Level 2</div>
                <div class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">Advance Mechanic</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">General Repair & Troubleshooting Kompleks</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Level 3 -->
            <div class="relative z-10 flex items-start gap-4 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-800 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Profesional</div>
                <div class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">Professional Mechanic</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Kompetensi Maintenance & General Repair Utuh</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Level 4 -->
            <div class="relative z-10 flex items-start gap-4 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-900 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">4</div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Kepemimpinan Teknik</div>
                <div class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">Lead Mechanic</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Supervisi Teknis & Quality Control Bengkel</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Level 5 -->
            <div class="relative z-10 flex items-start gap-4 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-brand-600/40">
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-950 text-brand-300 font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 ring-2 ring-brand-600/50">5</div>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Manajemen Bengkel</div>
                <div class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">Workshop Leader</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Pengelolaan Operasional & Kepemimpinan Tim</div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
